### Home
GET http://localhost:1205


### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:1205/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login Admin
POST http://localhost:1205/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Subscribe
POST http://localhost:1205/api/newsletter/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ashish@example.com"
}


### Unsubscribe
POST http://localhost:1205/api/newsletter/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ashish@example.com"
}


### Get Subscribers (Admin)
GET http://localhost:1205/api/newsletter/subscribers


### Logout Admin
POST http://localhost:1205/api/auth/logout